# PBMC model of the paper trained with the original implementation (upstream/). Tracks only the scripts, configs,
# metrics, causal graph and summary figures (PNG, the only format the original code writes); everything else
# (checkpoints, TensorBoard, per-step and per-run images, datasets, simulated cells, inferred GRNs, logs) stays local.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.sh
!*.py
!*.patch
!*.cfg
.config.*.cfg
!*.json
!*.txt
!data/processed/*/causal_graph.pkl
!gpu_usage.png
!results/GRouNdGAN*.png
!results/GRouNdGAN/generated*/*.png
!results/GRouNdGAN/infer_grn_*/generated/*.png
